> Compute cost before the dynamics update

At zero torque the immediate reward is minus the squared wrapped angle minus.1 times squared angular velocity. It is evaluated from the pre-step state; the next observation describes the integrated state.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/pendulum_worked.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main(){namespace e=dm::rl::environments;std::filesystem::create_directories("build");e::Pendulum env;env.reset(1);double angle=e::WrapAngle(env.theta()),velocity=env.theta_dot();double expected=-(angle*angle+.1*velocity*velocity);auto r=env.step(e::Action(std::vector<float>{0}));std::vector<double>values{expected,r.reward,double(r.terminated),double(r.truncated)};if(std::abs(expected-r.reward)>2e-6)return 1;std::print("| coordinate | computed value |\n|---:|---:|\n");for(size_t i=0;i<values.size();++i)std::print("| {} | {:.9f} |\n",i,values[i]);dm::nn::save_npz("build/pendulum_worked.npz",{{"values",dm::nn::from_vector(values)}});std::vector<double>x(values.size());std::iota(x.begin(),x.end(),0.);const double low=std::min(0.,*std::min_element(values.begin(),values.end())),high=std::max(0.,*std::max_element(values.begin(),values.end())),span=std::max(1e-9,high-low);dm::graphics::RPlot::create().ylim(low-.05*span,high+.05*span).bars(x,values,"computed values",{37,99,235}).title("Compute cost before the dynamics update").x_label("Coordinate in displayed calculation").size(1000,550).save_svg("build/pendulum_worked.svg");}
```
